<item><title>Nigerian banks look to cut diesel costs to keep services running</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/nigerian-banks-look-to-cut-diesel-costs-to-keep-services-2eba1b/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/nigerian-banks-look-to-cut-diesel-costs-to-keep-services-2eba1b/</guid><category>Nigeria</category><description>Power interruptions can halt transactions, and banks are seeking ways to reduce their reliance on diesel generators.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 11:27:37 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" length="32450" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Delta police investigate campaign clash as curfew covers Ughelli North</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/delta-police-investigate-campaign-clash-as-curfew-covers-4e98e7/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/delta-police-investigate-campaign-clash-as-curfew-covers-4e98e7/</guid><category>Nigeria</category><description>Police report six deaths and several injuries at a campaign event, while the state government restricts movement overnight across the local government area.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 08:50:29 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" length="32450" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
<item><title>Abuja court freezes N135.5 billion tied to Governors’ Forum</title><link>https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/abuja-court-freezes-n135-5-billion-tied-to-governors-forum-9b3efa/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://africanstreetjournal.com/ng/abuja-court-freezes-n135-5-billion-tied-to-governors-forum-9b3efa/</guid><category>Nigeria</category><description>The order bars the forum and 29 banks from moving the funds while the court considers a lawyer’s claim under a 2018 indemnity.</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:54:11 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" length="32450" type="image/jpeg"/><media:content url="https://africanstreetjournal.com/og/ng.jpg" medium="image" type="image/jpeg" width="1200" height="630"/></item>
